WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.350
It's President Maki.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.640
She's always so perfectly put together.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.060
She's like a work of art.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.270
She seems rather down today, though.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.820
Still, Princess Fuji is beautiful that way, too!

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.380
Nyobittsu!

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.580
Princess Fuji tripped so impishly!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.200
And what's with all the apples?

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Those apples must be necessary for 
some important student council work.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.880
She looks so confused!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.650
What's wrong, Maki?

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.820
Did you trip?

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.260
Are you okay?

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.440
Riko...

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.660
You don't usually make actual mistakes.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.730
<b>One Hand on Another</b>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.510
Y-You're right...

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.240
But, why the apples?

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.930
W-Well...

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.370
I accidentally took these 
instead of my paperwork...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.380
Is it even possible to 
make that kind of mistake?

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:13.570
I thought you were going to use 
these for some kind of love lab.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:15.520
N-No!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:16.480
Huh?

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.470
W-Well, we're about to become very busy,

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.720
so let's hold off on labs for a while.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.840
Oh, right!

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.020
I need to go to the faculty office!

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.480
Thank you, Riko.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.440
See you later!

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.900
Bennyogo!

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:35.060
She's not used to making honest mistakes, 
so she's making weird noises...

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.320
<i>Anyway, something's definitely up.</i>

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:41.740
<i>Maki wouldn't suggest holding 
off on love labs herself...</i>

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.830
<i>Did she overhear what I said back then?</i>

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.410
<i>I don't know for sure yet.</i>

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.710
<i>It's Maki we're talking about.</i>

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.220
<i>She might resume the love labs 
like nothing ever happened.</i>

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:13.980
Hey, Maki.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.020
What is it, Eno-senpai?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.320
What do you mean, "what"?

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.460
What's today's love lab?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.830
The underground paper's 
going to start printing soon.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.790
We can't take things too easy.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.220
We still have all these requests for 
advice Ichikawa-senpai brought us

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.080
for later issues of the paper.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.290
Well...

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.190
Um, some student council 
work has been piling up

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.090
since we began work on 
the underground paper,

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.900
so I was thinking of taking a break 
from love labs and taking care of this.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.850
Oh...

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.750
Did we have that much work piled up?

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:54.290
If Maki says so, it must be true.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:55.690
More importantly...

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.360
Something seems off...

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.800
Your calculation is wrong here.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.340
What?!

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:17.500
Oh, you're right!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.170
Thank you, Sayo-senpai.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.500
No problem...

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.340
But this isn't like you.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.140
I-I'm practicing being a girl 
who shows weaknesses.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.130
Oh, no!

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.690
I accidentally wrote a challenge 
letter instead of a love letter!

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.860
Seems like you'd be done for 
if you showed any weakness.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.970
Hey, Mak—

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.570
She totally jumped out of her skin.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.830
And then she fell.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.290
How did that happen?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.870
Isn't it funny?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:20.040
We haven't had a single 
love lab since then...

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.900
This is too depressing!

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.320
If things are going to be 
this awkward, I should just...

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.740
<i>I have to call her.</i>

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.650
<i>It might seem kind of unfair, but...</i>

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:34.620
Hey!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.710
You shouldn't call people so late at night!

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.200
Your calls are always so long, besides!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.760
B-But it's really important!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:46.890
Even more reason to talk face-to-face 
tomorrow instead of calling on the phone.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.830
You're right...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.300
I should face her when I tell her...

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:56.810
I'm so pathetic.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:57.860
Riko?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.260
More!

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.530
Get angrier at me!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.230
What?!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.960
Yell and curse at me more!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.560
Call me worthless and kick me!

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:08.660
Stop saying things the 
neighbors will misinterpret!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.000
<i>I'm going to tell her today...</i>

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.710
M-Maki...

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:25.200
Listen, I... um...

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.310
What is it?

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.220
It's you?!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.900
What's with the wig?

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.520
Eno and Suzu had something 
to do in the faculty office,

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.220
and I was bored, so I searched the room.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.910
This place really is a mess.

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.020
What is she going to do, throw a party?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.570
This is just the tip of the iceberg.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.320
I need to figure out how 
she spent the budget...

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.790
What is she going to use this for?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:51.540
She's so stupid sometimes, 
I can't understand her.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:52.870
Moboge!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.640
H-Hey, Maki?!

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.330
"Moboge"?

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.360
I-I'm okay.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.450
I just wasn't paying attention.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.010
Maki, um... I want to talk—

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.790
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:10.020
I have a special extra lesson 
at cram school today,

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.360
so I can't stay!

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.360
Goodbye.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.180
Ma—

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.180
She's so fast!

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.700
Stare...

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:25.670
I'm not in the mood to come up with a 
retort to a half-baked gag right now...

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.720
You've been acting weird lately.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.580
You still haven't told her?

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.950
I'm not ready to...

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.040
I know!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.260
Put on that wig you had before.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.500
I'll practice with you.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.920
What?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.460
I'll treat you to something sometime.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.670
I'm not feeling this.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.030
I be Maki!

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.870
You ruined her character 
with a single sentence!

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.910
I'll have the boys' heads today!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.220
It's "head over heels," idiot!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.720
Your glasses are bothering 
me! Look that way!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.290
Try to talk like Maki, too!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.970
You're asking for a lot.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.400
Riko, what did you want 
to talk to me about?

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.440
<i>This is more than just similar!</i>

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.320
Well, um, I...

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.450
Please hurry up. I'm getting annoyed.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:21.330
It's like finding crunchy bits
 of the clams in miso soup.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.130
You be quiet!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.120
And you're making jokes about clams again?!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.680
The first issue of the underground 
paper is almost complete.

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.610
Yes.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.640
Now that the storage room in the 
student council room is empty,

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.660
the newspaper association can finally move in.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.790
Myagonma!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.810
"Myagonma"?

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:40.680
It's Maki!

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.840
A-Are you okay?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.150
I'm... fine...

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.480
What are you doing?

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.730
Ah, I bet you're practicing 
being a clumsy girl.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.540
It's been so long, you 
couldn't resist going all out.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.910
As long as you're doing it,
 let's all do it together.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.150
We can get good advice from Riko-senpai.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.750
I can't believe Riko's 
stuck with you for so long.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.960
She's always dragged along 
when you get out of control.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.380
Just kidding!

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.430
O-Oh, no.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.180
My mouth doesn't close all the 
way lately, so I'm drooling.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.020
I'm taking a break from 
the student council today.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.400
It's drool!

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:31.100
I lied when I told you I'm popular with 
boys, but I didn't mean any harm...

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:35.070
I was just being stubborn, and the 
lie grew bigger than I expected...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.830
Weak excuses from a sore loser.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.550
It's like the adductor muscle that's 
hard to cut out of a clam shell.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:43.260
Stop talking about clams!

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.670
That's just your breakfast!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.580
You're not my friend anymore.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.290
You're a Ri-clam.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.720
D-Don't even joke about that!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:01.560
It's thinking things will change 
between us that scares me!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.040
Listen...

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:06.060
Are you the only one who's scared of that?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.230
Over-thinking with that
 unfortunate brain of yours

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.570
is preventing you from 
acting when you need to.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.490
Sayo-senpai...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.040
Yes, like a dud clam that 
doesn't open when cooked.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.950
Stop talking about clams!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.120
When we held that meeting...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.290
Huh?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.460
When we hijacked the broadcast room...

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.460
When I tried to quit the student council...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.380
What were you thinking then?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.120
I was...

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.170
It's an emergency!

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.300
It's Maki!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:40.260
She's acting weird and crying drool!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.680
No, she's drooling tears!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.080
That's certainly weird.

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.600
What's wrong with Maki?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.840
Come to think of it, you've 
been acting off lately, too.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:51.520
No wonder I'm starting to feel weird.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.820
Th-That's not...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.240
It is so. I mean...

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.780
You haven't made any retorts to Maki!

00:09:59.100 --> 00:09:59.990
Huh?

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:04.290
Well, maybe it's because Maki 
hasn't done anything silly lately...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.910
You're both acting too normally.

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:09.170
I... I...

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.510
I like you the way you usually are!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:16.350
Riko-senpai and Maki-senpai without 
silly gags and retorts aren't the same!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.670
Just what do you think we are?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:28.640
But...

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:30.460
Sayo-senpai,

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.120
Eno-senpai, Suzu...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.670
I'll make things right with you all, too...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.940
So I'm skipping student council today!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:39.960
Later!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.370
<i>Yes, that's it.</i>

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.640
<i>That's how you should be.</i>

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.170
Kurahashi must be struggling 
behind the scenes.

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:01.050
I hope your friendship 
isn't an assumption, too.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.910
<i>I can't even bring myself to go to cram school...</i>

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:05.830
Huh? Maki-san?

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:07.770
Nagino-kun.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.170
<i>Oh, man.</i>

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:13.810
<i>This feels so good.</i>

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.110
Aren't you going inside?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.690
W-Well...

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:19.860
Oh, are you waiting for Riko?

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:20.800
Huh?

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.450
Did something happen between you two?

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.400
Hey, it's Nagi.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.230
I haven't seen you since the last game.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:31.290
Yeah.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.420
I'm starting at this cram school today...

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:36.850
I'll kill you!

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.080
You've got the wrong idea!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.720
She's Riko's friend!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:40.420
Riko's?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.340
You know Riko?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.020
W-We went to elementary 
school together...

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.970
Is she really friends 
with that rough man-girl?

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.640
I really am!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:52.920
Really?

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:55.240
Her roughness will rub off on 
you if you hang around her.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:12:00.020
She isn't just unfeminine, she's a dude.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.990
But Riko is so cool, kind, and boys love her...

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.540
Boys love<i> Riko</i>?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.660
What, did she tell you that?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.030
The girls at Fuji Girls' sure are naïve.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:16.660
Maki!

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.140
Huh?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.100
Riko, you go to this cram school, too?

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.260
You shouldn't lie to the nice young lady.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.850
Well, I'm surprised she believed you, 
but that's a Fuji girl for you.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:33.270
What the hell's so funny?!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:35.870
See?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.230
This is the kind of girl she is...

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:41.860
Just so you know, I'm the 
only bad one at Fuji Girls'!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.820
<i>She trusted me...</i>

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:48.030
<i>but I hurt her.</i>

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.420
<i>I made a huge mistake!</i>

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:52.860
Maki...

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.460
Maki didn't do anything wrong!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.200
It's all...

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:57.830
all my fault...

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.250
It's me!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.490
Well, I wouldn't call it a lie.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.220
I used to like Riko.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.090
What?! Seriously?!

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:09.540
She rejected me, though...

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:13.350
Maki-san only said those things 
because she knew about that.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.470
You should apologize to her.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.580
Come on.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.080
S-Sorry!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:24.690
Maki...

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.110
Riko...

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.530
What?!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:34.440
<b>Humiliation</b>

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.930
What's up? A fight?

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:30.880
Where? Where?

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.010
I can't see!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.450
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.680
M-Maki!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.440
Ow!

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.340
This is so embarrassing...

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.300
All because of this stupid girl...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.220
Uh, um...

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.500
Just so you know, I only did it 
because I felt bad for Maki-san!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.220
It wasn't for you!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.410
You idiot!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.470
Loser!

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.000
Now that you know that...

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.480
Go after her.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:05.860
Y-Yeah.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.450
Nagi!

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.420
You really are a great guy!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.370
Thanks!

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:15.040
Sorry for embarrassing you!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.060
Later!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:21.180
Ah, she ran away.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:21.840
What?!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.300
Did she reject him again?

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.990
<b>Humiliated again</b>

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.510
Poor guy.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.850
Hey, great guy.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.680
Y-Yan-san! Did you just...

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.270
Don't call me Yan-san.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.600
I can't believe she rejected you.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.910
<i>And</i> you embarrassed 
yourself protecting her.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.040
I could never do that.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.440
Kurahashi doesn't know 
what she missed out on.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:44.590
Huh?

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.780
You're even worse off, though.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.510
It's huge.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.660
This is Maki's place?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.330
I never thought this stupid handkerchief

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.410
<b>I am a kind and simple girl

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:58.410
I confiscated from Maki 
would help me get here...

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:05.550
Riko.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.260
M-Maki...

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.960
Sorry about before.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:14.260
I was just so upset...

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.600
Y-Yeah, I can understand.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:17.760
Oh...

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.370
I'm surprised you found this place.

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.030
Yeah, I used this handkerchief.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:24.160
That's...

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:28.440
So that strategy works, after all.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.780
It's just a coincidence, stupid.

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:34.540
Sorry!

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.160
What?

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.830
<i>Kneeling is the coward's way out!</i>

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:41.750
Th-This rug smells nice...

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.300
By the way!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.170
<i>This seems a little patronizing...</i>

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:48.950
<i>What if I lean over?</i>

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.340
<i>No, now it looks like I'm relaxing!</i>

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.760
<i>In that case...</i>

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.970
I need to talk to you!

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:00.230
Um, why don't you sit down?

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.100
Sorry!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:05.480
I'm not a master of love!

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.820
I've only ever had my heart broken...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.100
I'm a beginner at romance, just like you!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:17.980
I'm sorry I lied to you and hurt you.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:28.920
Is that all?

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.760
Is that all you're hiding?

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:34.800
Yeah...

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.290
<i>She's mad.</i>

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.910
<i>Of course she is...</i>

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:40.750
<i>That's why we became 
friends in the first place...</i>

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.810
<i>Of course she can't trust me now...</i>

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:46.770
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:50.680
I'm sorry I'm so stupid.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.950
Sorry... I'm sorry.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.980
I'll stay away from you from now on...

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.490
I'll quit the student counci—

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.790
I'll... quit...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.000
<i>Riko.</i>

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:21.860
I'll...

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:24.810
I...

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:30.820
I don't want to quit!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:37.530
I know I'm being selfish...

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:44.290
But I want to keep goofing 
around with everyone...

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.220
I want to be your friend...

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:50.730
Your best friend.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.140
Now we're even.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.450
I'm relieved...

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.270
I'd actually been feeling uneasy for a while.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:10.250
I thought you had been forcing yourself

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:13.780
to spend time with me 
because of my assumptions...

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.610
Maki...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:20.800
You told me not to use that handkerchief 
because it was dangerous, remember?

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.260
I was so happy when you did.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.580
I just stated the obvious...

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:30.600
I didn't want to be 
friends with you forever

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:35.200
because I thought you 
were a master of love.

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.400
I want to be your friend

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.920
because you think helping people 
is the obvious thing to do.

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:47.690
When you asked me what I'd think 
if you were a beginner in love...

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.480
Honestly, I felt a little 
sad and disappointed.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:56.200
But, more than that, I'm happy.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.830
We'll get to experience all 
kinds of things together

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.370
and worry about things 
from the same perspective.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.330
Nothing could be more 
wonderful than this!

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:06.740
So...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:11.210
I hope you'll continue 
spending time with me.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:15.040
Riko, my best friend.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.900
Oh, Riko...

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:25.940
You're like a child...

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:33.870
S-So are you!

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.660
What? Really?

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.200
I'm really sorry I'm not 
someone you can look up to!

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:52.120
That's not why I looked up to you!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.290
I always looked up to the W-K Riko-senpai!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:55.280
<b>The Wild Kid</b>

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:03.180
It must have been difficult for you to bring up 
since we were always so excited about it...

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.930
Suzu...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:06.770
You should be angrier!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.740
But that's what I love about you!

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:14.940
You're kidding...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:15.610
Really?

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:17.230
I'm sorry!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.440
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.580
You bossed us around like you knew it all!

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:22.950
I don't believe this!

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.130
Wh-What?

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.700
It's your own fault, isn't it?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.430
Look, you! You'll be my underling for a while!

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.300
I'll work you hard!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.830
I'm glad your heart's a normal size...

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.850
But that's what I love about—

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.350
I wasn't worried like you were.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:46.990
After all, this place is full of idiots.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:47.930
What's that?!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.510
Sayo-senpai...

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.180
Of course, I'll make you set things right.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.060
Suzu.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:56.520
Ah, this is why you had me make this.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.900
My super strong slapstick!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:20:59.940
Huh?!

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.060
My, how nice.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:04.230
It's big, but easy to use.

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:08.080
As you requested, its striking power 
is 1.8 times greater than normal.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.810
I accomplished this by 
adding a thin veneer.

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:12.040
Well done.

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:12.870
What?

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.810
I won't hit you in the face.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.920
W-Wait, time out...

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.510
Get her!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.500
Hey, stop—

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:23.880
Ow!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.570
Excuse us.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.390
Oh?

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:30.620
Did something happen?

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:34.230
We were just strengthening the 
bonds of the student council.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.270
Oh, could it be...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.360
Thank you for waiting.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.020
It's finally complete!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.760
The life raft for young 
girls troubled by love,

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:45.190
brought to you by the student 
council and school paper...

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.610
The first issue of the underground paper!

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:56.540
Great! It's wonderful! It's fantastic!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.260
It's not bad.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.630
It's put together well.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:01.200
Of course it is.

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.500
Momo-senpai put everything 
she had into this paper.

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.350
I didn't do it alone.

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:08.340
I had Nana-chan and the rest 
of the newspaper association...

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:12.040
And most of all, the passion 
of the student council.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:14.070
Everyone!

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:16.540
We can't just stand here!

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:18.730
We must begin conducting 
love labs immediately

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.020
in preparation for the 
second underground paper!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:22.860
I'll do my best!

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:25.110
I-I suppose I have no choice.

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:27.340
I'll help you, too.

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:28.860
Sure, I guess.

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:30.280
Riko.

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:32.930
All right!

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:34.620
Let's get this love lab started!

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:37.070
Yeah!
